[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000]   Starting next week, all technical support cases must include the device serial number, software version, and steps taken before the problem occurred.
[00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000]   This will help the engineering team investigate without repeatedly requesting basic information.
[00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000]   Do not ask customers to send passwords.
[00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000]   For cases involving unexpected shutdowns, also request the event log if it can be exported safely.
[00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000]   The new form is on the support portal.
[00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.440]   A 15-minute walkthrough will be held online this Thursday at 10.
